WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The storm tested every connection in Port Azure. Reports were incomplete. Evidence conflicted. Tools failed, routes changed, and resources remained finite. You responded by structuring uncertainty, grounding decisions, coordinating specialists, and asking for human approval when the impact was high. The city is not restored by one perfect answer or one heroic unit. Recovery comes from decisions that others can verify, challenge, and improve. Essential services are stabilizing. The lighthouse is shining again. Carry these practices beyond Port Azure: preserve evidence, design clear contracts, recover safely, and keep people at the center.
